9C4.79165 6.79578 4.78571 7.23048 4.67271 7.636L8.89525 10.0283C9.63568 9.28725 10.8222 9.09762 11.7826 9.64318C12.9215 10.2879 13.3111 11.7145 12.6539 12.8319C11.9967 13.9493 10.5426 14.3315 9.40374 13.6867C8.44326 13.1441 8.01506 12.0413 8.30053 11.0406L4.07501 8.64542H4.07204ZM11.2147 3.3474C11.7826 3.02648 11.9789 2.31172 11.6488 1.75449C11.3217 1.19726 10.5932 1.00472 10.0252 1.32855C9.45727 1.64946 9.26101 2.36423 9.59108 2.92146C9.91818 3.47868 10.6467 3.67123 11.2147 3.3474ZM9.99847 12.6744C10.5664 12.9953 11.295 12.8057 11.6221 12.2484C11.9492 11.6912 11.7559 10.9764 11.1879 10.6555C10.62 10.3346 9.89142 10.5242 9.56432 11.0815C9.23722 11.6387 9.4305 12.3535 9.99847 12.6744Z6:["$","div",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"trigger":["$","button",null,{"className":"btn big p-0 cursor-pointer","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-wolkenwit btn-icon-bg origin-left"}],["$","strong",null,{"className":"relative -left-[1px] ","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"btn-icon text-nachtblauw","children":[["$","em",null,{"className":"","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":"13","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 13 14","fill":"none","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"$12","fill":"currentColor"}]}]}],["$","em",null,{"className":"","children":["$","svg",null,{"width":"13","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 13 14","fill":"none","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"$13","fill":"currentColor"}]}]}]]}]}]]}]}]}]}]
7:["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-7 prose prose-1","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Private travel is not just for business. As an individual traveller, chartering a private aircraft can be both a sensible and thoroughly enjoyable choice. The flexibility that is sometimes essential for the business traveller is, of course, equally appealing for personal journeys. And when travelling with a group, a private flight can also be a financially attractive alternative to business class on a commercial airline."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"children":"Aerodynamics arranges the journey and so much more"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"At Aerodynamics, it is not just about arranging a flight from A to B. The entire journey is taken care of, from planning through to execution. This includes personal advice on the most suitable aircraft, assistance in putting together your travel schedule and support with additional requests such as catering, transfers to and from the airport or specific baggage requirements."}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"Thanks to years of experience and an extensive network within the aviation industry, Aerodynamics can act swiftly and deliver tailor-made solutions. Whether you are planning a short flight within Europe or an intercontinental journey, every detail is arranged so that you can focus entirely on the purpose of your trip or simply sit back and relax."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"children":"Why more and more travellers are choosing private flights"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Private aviation is growing rapidly in popularity, and for good reason. Travellers particularly value the time savings: no lengthy check-in procedures, no security queues and direct access to smaller airports closer to the final destination."}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"Comfort also plays a major role. You travel in a calm, exclusive environment, free from the crowds of other passengers. Privacy is an important advantage, particularly for business conversations or when you wish to work without interruption."}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"Flexibility is equally decisive. Flights can often be adjusted at short notice, and you are not bound by fixed schedules. This makes private flights ideal for both business travel and spontaneous personal journeys."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"children":"The ultimate guide to your first private flight"}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":"For your first private flight, simply share your requirements, such as destination, travel dates and number of passengers. Based on this, the most suitable aircraft is arranged and you receive a clear itinerary."}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":"On the day of departure, you typically need to arrive just 15 minutes before take-off. You are assisted quickly and personally and board almost immediately."}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":"During the flight, you enjoy tranquillity, comfort and tailored service. After arrival, you are swiftly on your way to your final destination. This makes travel not only more efficient, but a great deal more enjoyable."}]]}]}]
